@startuml Edit Request Alternate Flow - State Diagram
title Edit Request Alternate Flow - State Diagram

[*] --> Authenticated

Authenticated --> ViewHome: Navigate to VTS

ViewHome --> ViewBalance: Display request summary\nand balances

ViewBalance --> SelectRequest: Employee selects\npending request

SelectRequest --> PendingApprovalState: Request status:\nPending Approval

PendingApprovalState --> EditableView: VTS displays editable\nview of request

EditableView --> EmployeeEdits: Employee can modify:\ntitle, comments, dates

EmployeeEdits --> SubmitChanges: Employee submits\nchanges

SubmitChanges --> WithdrawDecision: Employee chooses to\nwithdraw request?

WithdrawDecision --> ConfirmWithdraw: Yes - Confirm withdraw
WithdrawDecision --> ValidateChanges: No - Validate changes

ConfirmWithdraw --> PromptConfirm: VTS prompts for\nconfirmation

PromptConfirm --> WithdrawConfirmed: Withdraw confirmed

WithdrawConfirmed --> Withdrawn: Request withdrawn\nfrom pending approvals

Withdrawn --> ReturnHome: Return to home page

ValidateChanges --> ValidationPasses: Changes are valid
ValidateChanges --> ValidationFails: Changes have errors

ValidationPasses --> AcceptChanges: Changes accepted

AcceptChanges --> ReturnHome: Return to home page

ValidationFails --> RedisplayEdit: Redisplay edit page\nwith errors highlighted

RedisplayEdit --> EmployeeEdits: Employee reviews\nand corrects errors

ReturnHome --> [*]

note right of PendingApprovalState
  Precondition: Request must be
  pending approval
end note

note right of EmployeeEdits
  Employee can edit title,
  comments, or dates
end note

note right of ValidateChanges
  Changes must pass system
  validation rules
end note

note right of Withdrawn
  Request removed from
  manager's queue
end note

@enduml
